* Update the following as best as you can:

** Category (Product - Issue) (Use Proper Product names as listed above, avoid abbreviations)
                *** SPX - Service will not start
                *** ImageManager - Cannot remove files older than the last replicated file
                *** CloudBackup - No Access to Provider

** FEED View (chat bubble icon):

        *** If information is missing, request via email using the following formula.

            **** Such as Request logs, error messages that they are seeing, screenshots if applicable, etcetera.

        *** Change FROM: to "Customer Success"
        *** Change the signature to read "Customer Success Team" instead of your name.

        Example signature:

<<<
Customer Success Team | Technical Support Specialist | StorageCraft Technology Corporation
        380 Data Drive Suite 300 | Draper | Utah | 84020 |
        Office: 801.545.4710
<<<

** DETAILS View:
*** Update action plan using this formula: "[# request] – [note for next person]"

            **** [# request] e.g. 1st request, 2nd Request, 3rd Request

            **** [note for next person] The note should be detailed but short. e.g. "requested logs", "requested clarification", etcetera
    *** If pending required data (see above) from Partner, use [[Back to Queue]], elsewise use [[Ready for T2]]

